# Build-context filter for the secret-engine image ONLY.
#
# BuildKit uses `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the repo-root
# .dockerignore, so this trims the context for this image without affecting
# vault-ui (which genuinely needs ui/) or any other build.
#
# Why: the root context is ~754 MB, of which ui/ alone is ~696 MB and the
# non-Rust SDKs another ~39 MB. None of it is used to compile a Rust service,
# but all of it was being transferred to the builder on every build — and any
# change under ui/ invalidated the cache for a service that cannot even see it.
# Excluding it takes the context to a few MB.

.git
target
**/target

# Frontend: not part of any Rust build (~696 MB).
ui

# Only sdks/rust is a Cargo workspace member; the rest are other languages.
sdks/js
sdks/python
sdks/go
sdks/java
sdks/dotnet

# Not needed to compile.
deploy
docs
examples
scripts
storage
gateway
*.md
